LORAWAN_DEVICE_EUI|LoRaWAN device EUI|se-identity||||End-device IEEE EUI (big endian) When set to 00,00,00,00,00,00,00,00 DevEui is automatically set with a value provided by MCU platform
LORAWAN_JOIN_EUI|App/Join EUI|se-identity||||App/Join IEEE EUI (big endian)
LORAWAN_GEN_APP_KEY|Gen Application Key|se-identity||||Network root key (big endian) in OTAA Activation Type Used to derive the Network session and Application session keys
LORAWAN_APP_KEY|Application key|se-identity||||Application root key (big endian) in OTAA Activation Type Used to derive the Multicast session keys
LORAWAN_DEVICE_ADDRESS|Device Address|se-identity||||Device address on the network (big endian) When set to 00,00,00,00 DevAddr is automatically set with a value provided by MCU platform
LORAWAN_NWK_S_KEY|Network session key|se-identity||||Network session key (big endian) in ABP Activation Type WARNING: NWK_S_KEY FOR 1.0.x DEVICES
LORAWAN_APP_S_KEY|Application session key|se-identity||||Application session key (big endian) in ABP Activation Type
Activate_DEBUG_LINE|Probes Lines in Platform Settings|board settings||||Enable Probes Line using GPIO under Plaform Settings panel
Activate_BOARD_RESOURCES|Board Resources|board settings||||Enable LEDs and BUTTONs settings using GPIO under Plaform Settings panel or via .extSettings file
LORAWAN_TIMER_OR_BUTTON|Send Tx on Timer or Button Evt|board settings||||
ACTIVE_REGION|Active region|lora_app||||List of available regions is set in lorawan_conf.h available under LoRaWAN middleware panel
APP_TX_DUTYCYCLE|Transmition duty cycle|lora_app||||
LORAWAN_USER_APP_PORT|Application user port|lora_app||1|199|
