LORAMAC_SPECIFICATION_VERSION|Select the LoRaWAN Link Layer specification version|lorawan_conf||||LoRaWAN Link Layer and Regional Parameters configuration - v1.0.4: Link Layer TS001-1.0.4 + Regional Parameters RP002-1.0.1
LORAWAN_DATA_DISTRIB_MGT|Enable the additional LoRaWAN packages|lorawan_conf||||LoRaWAN Packages configuration including: - Application Layer Clock Synchronization (Package ID: 1, Default Port: 202) - Remote Multicast Setup (Package ID: 2, Default Port: 200) - Fragmented Data Block Transport (Package ID: 3, Default Port: 201) - Firmware Management Protocol (Package ID: 4, Default Port: 203) The Certification Protocol is also defined as a mandatory package (Package ID: 0, Default Port: 224)
LORAWAN_PACKAGES_VERSION|Select the LoRaWAN packages version|lorawan_conf||||LoRaWAN Packages version configuration: The v1.0.0 packages including: - Application Layer Clock Synchronization v1.0.0 - Remote Multicast Setup v1.0.0 - Fragmented Data Block Transport v1.0.0 The v2.0.0 packages including: - Application Layer Clock Synchronization v2.0.0 - Remote Multicast Setup v2.0.0 - Fragmented Data Block Transport v2.0.0 - Firmware Management Protocol v1.0.0
MW_LOG_ENABLED|Enable Middleware log|mw_log_conf||||
RF_WAKEUP_TIME|Radio maximum wakeup time (in ms)|radio_conf||||Radio maximum wakeup time (in ms)
Activate_RADIO_BOARD_INTERFACE|Select radio Driver|radio_board_if||||UserBoard: user to complete; Bsp: need to be included in the IDE; NucleoPseudo: just x backward compatibility.
IS_TCXO_SUPPORTED|TCXO support|radio_board_if||||Indicates whether or not TCXO is supported by the board. TCXO needs to be selected in RCC panel (HSE clock)
IS_DCDC_SUPPORTED|DCDC support|radio_board_if||||Indicates whether or not DCDC is supported by the board
TX_RFO_CONFIG|Tx Rfo Config|radio_board_if||||Indicates the config

